# 🗺️ COMPREHENSIVE NAVIGATION RESTRUCTURE PLAN
## From Orphaned Co-Pilots to Product-Capability Hierarchy

**Created:** 2024-12-19  
**Status:** 🟢 READY - Complete Navigation Restructure  
**Problem:** Co-pilots are orphaned at `/platform/[coPilotSlug]`, not connected to products or capabilities  
**Solution:** Hierarchical structure: Products → Capabilities → Co-Pilots

